Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 14:11:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] test: add the gain/pan diagnosis harnesses the draft spec
 cites

Two ignored measurement tests in console-workload: gain_pan_profile
(graph phase profile of the plumbing, gain/pan, dispatch-only and
builtins-only rows, plus 64-block digests of every standing workload)
and gain_pan_replicas (the row's banked stages through the real builtins
bank API and lane kernels, the class-A candidates asserted bit-identical,
and settled-versus-ramping costs). They assert nothing about time.

